is system-deep-loop, the command's owner.\",\"searchActions\":[{\"evidenceRefs\":[\"command-attach.ts:414\",\"command-attach.ts:419\"],\"method\":\"direct_read\",\"queryOrPath\":\"command-attach.ts:360-431\",\"result\":\"Leads are anchored directly before each occurrence; the gap cannot cross a command token.\"},{\"evidenceRefs\":[\"probes/probe-scorer.vitest.ts\"],\"method\":\"probe\",\"queryOrPath\":\"typedCommandForTop('system-deep-loop', 'do not run /deep:review or /deep:research')\",\"result\":\"Returns /deep:research with policy ask.\"}],\"targetRefs\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts\"]},{\"bugClass\":\"guard_gap\",\"dimension\":\"correctness\",\"disposition\":\"finding\",\"hypothesis\":\"Generic creation words in a correction clause stand the small-edit gate down.\",\"id\":\"SL-003\",\"linkedFindingId\":\"SA4-P1-003\",\"rationale\":\"The exact REQ-004 controls pass, but the class the phase purpose names still attaches the creation workflow.\",\"searchActions\":[{\"evidenceRefs\":[\"command-attach.ts:331\",\"command-attach.ts:487\"],\"method\":\"direct_read\",\"queryOrPath\":\"command-attach.ts:324-339,478-492\",\"result\":\"The creation regex includes make, new, add a and need an.\"},{\"evidenceRefs\":[\"probes/probe-scorer.vitest.ts\"],\"method\":\"probe\",\"queryOrPath\":\"compiled-route and attachCommand for four correction prompts\",\"result\":\"All route to sk-create-readme and return /create:readme.\"}],\"targetRefs\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts\"]},{\"bugClass\":\"boundary_parsing\",\"dimension\":\"correctness\",\"disposition\":\"ruled_out\",\"id\":\"SL-004\",\"invariant\":\"A longer command name must not read as its shorter prefix, and a mode suffix must end the command name.\",\"rationale\":\"No finding.\",\"ruledOutReason\":\"The changed boundary tests pass and the probe finds no prefix or suffix leak.\",\"searchActions\":[{\"evidenceRefs\":[\"command-attach.ts:228-232\"