metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read file .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/assets/deep-review-strategy.md, lines 195-218\n195: ## 17. EXAMPLE (POPULATED)\n196: \n197: Reference snippet showing a partially populated strategy file mid-review. Use this as a visual anchor when opening a live strategy doc.\n198: \n199: ```markdown\n200: ## 1. REVIEW CHARTER\n201: - Target: .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research (skill, v1.4.0)\n202: - Dimensions: correctness, test-coverage, cross-runtime-parity, observability\n203: - Stop conditions: rolling newInfoRatio < 0.08 for 2 iterations OR all dimensions converged OR max=7 reached\n204: - Success criteria: zero P0 in correctness; test-coverage P0 resolved or deferred with rationale\n205: \n206: ## 4. NEXT FOCUS\n207: - Dimension: test-coverage\n208: - Files: .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/reduce-state.cjs, .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/tests/deep-research-contract-parity.vitest.ts\n209: - Why: Iteration 2 surfaced a P0 (convergence-path coverage gap); needs a focused follow-up before correctness can terminate PASS.\n210: \n211: ## 9. COVERAGE MATRIX\n212: | Dimension            | Status     | Iterations touched |\n213: |----------------------|------------|--------------------|\n214: | correctness          | converged  | 1                  |\n215: | test-coverage        | converging | 2, 4               |\n216: | cross-runtime-parity | converging | 3                  |\n217: | observability        | converging | 4                  |\n218: ```"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"limit\":90,\"offset\":195,\"path\":\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/assets/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794680626153,"end":1794680627047}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794680627055,"sessionID":"ses_e24b9ad86ffemxqRFlUJ7Tx0bg","part":{"partID":"prt_1db4d1daa001ngIT1bQ07IBaU4","sessionID":"ses_e24b9ad86ffemxqRFlUJ7Tx0bg","messageID":"msg_1db4d0a79001hYjq0Ojp2x3gRa","type":"tool","id":"call_5bedb957d823483b884ca8e1","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"sed -n '1,80p' specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-4/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"---\ntitle: Deep Review Strategy - scorer-attach-4 lineage\ndescription: Runtime strategy tracking review progress for the scorer-attach fan-out lineage, fourth pass of command surfacing.\nversion: 1.11.14.0\n---\n\n# Deep Review Strategy - scorer-attach-4 lineage\n\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\n### Purpose\n\nPersistent brain for this fan-out lineage. It records which dimensions remain, what was found\n(P0/P1/P2), which review approaches worked or failed, and where to focus next. Read at every\niteration before any review action.\n\n### Ownership\n\nMachine-managed metrics and coverage blocks are wrapped in explicit ownership markers. Human\ncommentary and operator overrides live outside those markers.\n\n---\n\n## 2. TOPIC\n\nReview pass four of `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build`\nin the `scorer-attach` area. Scope: the eleven changed paths listed in\n`review/review-scope-4.txt` whose area is `scorer-attach` — the attach module, the recommend\nhandler, the scorer modules that gate command rows, and their tests — plus shared docs that\ndescribe them. The change range is `0cdc9fa3ef..400c90e158` (HEAD at dispatch).\n\nThe operator focus is the pass-four brief: checks on claude, codex, opencode, pi, devin and dsh;\na refusal, question or bare mention of a command still attaching or starting a mutating command;\nthe transcript scorer's load/followed/offer arithmetic; holdout hygiene; and docs that disagree\nwith code.\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\n[All dimensions complete]\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n\n---\n\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n\n- The renderer, hooks, plugin, session readers and doctor command docs are the\n  `render-hooks-plugin-4` and `doctor-docs-4` lineages' scope. This lineage reads them only as\n  context evidence.\n- The transcript scorer, command-offer harness, capture baseline and corpus files are the\n  `accuracy-runner-4` lineage's scope. The operator focus asks about their arithmetic; this\n  lineage records the boundary and does not raise code findings outside it.\n- Holdout prompt text is never read or printed. Corpus work is limited to counts and\n  `jq 'del(.prompt)'` rows.\n- No code changes: review is observation-only.\n\n---\n\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\n\n- Convergence: `newFindingsRatio` at or below the 0.10 threshold with no active P0.\n- Cap: `maxIterations` 4.\n- Stuck: two consecutive iterations with no new evidence (stuckThreshold 2).\n- Any active P0 blocks PASS regardless of convergence.\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\n## 4. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\n- [x] correctness\n- [x] security\n- [x] traceability\n- [x] maintainability\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\n\n---\n\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\ntitle: Deep Review Strategy - scorer-attach-4 lineage\ndescription: Runtime strategy tracking review progress for the scorer-attach fan-out lineage, fourth pass of command surfacing.\nversion: 1.11.14.0\n---\n\n# Deep Review Strategy - scorer-attach-4 lineage\n\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\n### Purpose\n\nPersistent brain for this fan-out lineage. It records which dimensions remain, what was found\n(P0/P1/P2), which review approaches worked or failed, and where to focus next. Read at every\niteration before any review action.\n\n### Ownership\n\nMachine-managed metrics and coverage blocks are wrapped in explicit ownership markers. Human\ncommentary and operator overrides live outside those markers.\n\n---\n\n## 2. TOPIC\n\nReview pass four of `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build`\nin the `scorer-attach` area. Scope: the eleven changed paths listed in\n`review/review-scope-4.txt` whose area is `scorer-attach` — the attach module, the recommend\nhandler, the scorer modules that gate command rows, and their tests — plus shared docs that\ndescribe them. The change range is `0cdc9fa3ef..400c90e158` (HEAD at dispatch).\n\nThe operator focus is the pass-four brief: checks on claude, codex, opencode, pi, devin and dsh;\na refusal, question or bare mention of a command still attaching or starting a mutating command;\nthe transcript scorer's load/followed/offer arithmetic; holdout hygiene; and docs that disagree\nwith code.\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\n[All dimensions complete]\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n\n---\n\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n\n- The renderer, hooks, plugin, session readers and doctor command docs are the\n  `render-hooks-plugin-4` and `doctor-docs-4` lineages' scope. This lineage reads them only as\n  context evidence.\n- The transcript scorer, command-offer harness, capture baseline and corpus files are the\n  `accuracy-runner-4` lineage's scope. The operator focus asks about their arithmetic; this\n  lineage records the boundary and does not raise code findings outside it.\n- Holdout prompt text is never read or printed. Corpus work is limited to counts and\n  `jq 'del(.prompt)'` rows.\n- No code changes: review is observation-only.\n\n---\n\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\n\n- Convergence: `newFindingsRatio` at or below the 0.10 threshold with no active P0.\n- Cap: `maxIterations` 4.\n- Stuck: two consecutive iterations with no new evidence (stuckThreshold 2).\n- Any active P0 blocks PASS regardless of convergence.\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\n## 4. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\n- [x] correctness\n- [x] security\n- [x] traceability\n- [x] maintainability\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\n\n---\n\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"sed -n '1,80p' specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-4/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794680626602,"end":1794680627055}}}}
