{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794680728524,"sessionID":"ses_e24b9ad86ffemxqRFlUJ7Tx0bg","part":{"partID":"prt_1db4e6669001uFtLWuvCDxnYzJ","sessionID":"ses_e24b9ad86ffemxqRFlUJ7Tx0bg","messageID":"msg_1db4e4d140012UgUBiieGxaIs6","type":"tool","id":"call_73b2c85305134da69cd4cc71","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"---\ntitle: Deep Review Strategy - accuracy-runner-confirm-4b lineage\ndescription: Runtime strategy tracking the confirming review of pass-four fixes in the accuracy-runner area of command surfacing.\nversion: 1.11.14.0\n---\n\n# Deep Review Strategy - accuracy-runner-confirm-4b lineage\n\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\n### Purpose\n\nPersistent brain for this fan-out lineage. It records which dimensions remain, what was found\n(P0/P1/P2), which review approaches worked or failed, and where to focus next. Read at every\niteration before any review action.\n\n### Ownership\n\nMachine-managed metrics and coverage blocks are wrapped in explicit ownership anchors. Human\ncommentary and operator overrides live outside those anchors.\n\n---\n\n## 2. TOPIC\n\nConfirming round of review pass four of `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build`\nin the `accuracy-runner` area. Scope: the nine changed paths listed in\n`review/review-scope-4b.txt` whose area is `accuracy-runner` — the Codex session reader and its\ntest, the routing-accuracy offer/runner pair and their tests, and the doctor presentation row —\nplus shared docs that describe them. The change range is `11af224a34..48f03b5013`.\n\nThe operator focus is the pass-four confirming brief: read `review-brief-4b.txt` first; confirm\nthat a refusal over an or-list and an is-the question carry no command while a request over a\nlist keeps its command; that both run-log writers keep `offeredAs`; that a shell read of a\ncommand document counts as a start while a search, an in-place `sed`, a redirect and a heredoc\nline do not; that a heredoc end word with a hyphen or a dot closes correctly; that the Codex\nreader opens the resolved file; that the holdout guard reads the live capture; and that docs\nagree with code. Holdout prompt text is never read or printed.\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\n- [x] D1 Correctness\n- [ ] D2 Security\n- [ ] D3 Traceability\n- [ ] D4 Maintainability\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n\n---\n\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n\n- The attach module, scorer fusion, recommend handler and feature docs in the `scorer-attach`\n  area are the `scorer-attach-confirm-4b` lineage's scope. This lineage reads them only as\n  context evidence and raises no finding against them.\n- Holdout prompt text is never read or printed. Corpus work is limited to counts and\n  `jq 'del(.prompt)'` rows.\n- No code changes: review is observation-only.\n- No runtime command, build, test run or generator is executed; every claim is grounded in a\n  direct file read of the changed commit.\n\n---\n\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\n\n- Convergence: `newFindingsRatio` at or below the 0.10 threshold with no active P0.\n- Cap: `maxIterations` 3.\n- Stuck: two consecutive iterations with no new evidence (stuckThreshold 2).\n- Any active P0 blocks PASS regardless of convergence.\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\n## 4. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\n\n| Dimension | Verdict | Iteration | Summary |\n|-----------|---------|-----------|---------|\n| [D1 Correctness] | [pending] | [N] | [result] |\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:running-findings -->\n## 5. RUNNING FINDINGS\n- **P0 (Critical):** 0 active\n- **P1 (Major):** 0 active\n- **P2 (Minor):** 0 active\n- **Delta this iteration:** +0 P0, +0 P1, +0 P2\n\nFindings are tracked in `deep-review-findings-registry.json`. This section is the running count\nsummary refreshed after each iteration.\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:running-findings -->\n\n---\n\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\n\n- [First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n\n---\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n\n- [First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n## 9. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n[No exhausted approach yet]\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n\n---\n\n## 10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER\n\n- Completed pivots: 0\n- Failed pivots: 0\n- Audited overrides: 0\n- Swept: none yet\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\n- Remaining frontier: none recorded\n\n---\n\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\n\n- [Populated when an iteration rules a direction out, with its evidence]\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n## 11. NEXT FOCUS\n\n- Dimension: correctness\n- Focus: the `offeredAs` persistence fix in both run-log writers, the replay parser, and the\n  live turn append.\n- Files: `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-offer.mjs`,\n  `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs`,\n  their two changed tests.\n- Reason: confirm the P1 fix that dropped `offeredAs` and look for defects the fix added.\n- Required evidence: direct reads of every writer, plus the scorer's reader of `offeredAs`.\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n\n---\n\n## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\n\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\n\n- Target pointers: the nine `accuracy-runner` paths in `review/review-scope-4b.txt`; the fix\n  commit `48f03b5013`; the verify report `review/verify-4/report.md`.\n- Behavior claims: `offeredAs` travels with an offer through both writers; a partner-side\n  command is not counted as an offer; a Codex rollout link is read at its resolved path; an A11\n  malformed router row is fixed by hand rather than by embed.\n- Reuse and conventions: the reader containment pattern already used by `claude.mjs`; the\n  `P0/P1/P2` scale; the delta + iteration narrative pair; the append gateway as sole state-log\n  writer.\n- Review risks and gaps: no live per-runtime session was captured in this lineage, so runtime\n  behaviour is read from code and tests. The scorer and corpus are a sibling lineage's surface;\n  this lineage reads them only to check the docs it owns.\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:cross-reference-status -->\n## 14. CROSS-REFERENCE STATUS\n\n| Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\n|----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\n| `spec_code` | core | pending | - | - |\n| `checklist_evidence` | core | pending | - | - |\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | notApplicable | - | No agent definition changed in this area. |\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | pending | - | - |\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | pending | - | - |\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | notApplicable | - | No playbook surface changed. |\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:cross-reference-status -->\n\n---\n\n## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\n\n| File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\n|------|-------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-offer.mjs` | - | - | - | pending |\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs` | - | - | - | pending |\n| `.skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/codex.mjs` | - | - | - | pending |\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md` | - | - | - | pending |\n| `.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-presentation.txt` | - | - | - | pending |\n\n---\n\n## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\n\n- Max iterations: 3\n- Convergence threshold: 0.10\n- Rolling STOP threshold: 0.08\n- No-progress threshold: 0.05\n- Coverage stabilization passes required: 1\n- Session lineage: sessionId=fanout-accuracy-runner-confirm-4b-1794680176420-xvj4ed,\n  parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new\n- Findings registry: `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\n- Release-readiness states: in-progress | converged | release-blocking\n- Per-iteration budget: 12 tool calls, 10 minutes\n- Severity threshold: P2\n- Review target type: spec-folder\n- Cross-reference checks: core=[spec_code, checklist_evidence],\n  overlay=[skill_agent, agent_cross_runtime, feature_catalog_code, playbook_capability]\n- Started: 2026-11-14T18:24:38Z\n","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-confirm-4b/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-confirm-4b/deep-review-strategy.md","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-confirm-4b/deep-review-strategy.md"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\":\"---\\ntitle: Deep Review Strategy - accuracy-runner-confirm-4b lineage\\ndescription: Runtime strategy tracking the confirming review of pass-four fixes in the accuracy-runner area of command surfacing.\\nversion: 1.11.14.0\\n---\\n\\n# Deep Review Strategy - accuracy-runner-confirm-4b lineage\\n\\n## 1. OVERVIEW\\n\\n### Purpose\\n\\nPersistent brain for this fan-out lineage. It records which dimensions remain, what was found\\n(P0/P1/P2), which review approaches worked or failed, and where to focus next. Read at every\\niteration before any review action.\\n\\n### Ownership\\n\\nMachine-managed metrics and coverage blocks are wrapped in explicit ownership anchors. Human\\ncommentary and operator overrides live outside those anchors.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. TOPIC\\n\\nConfirming round of review pass four of `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build`\\nin the `accuracy-runner` area. Scope: the nine changed paths listed in\\n`review/review-scope-4b.txt` whose area is `accuracy-runner` — the Codex session reader and its\\ntest