/accuracy-runner-confirm-4b/deep-review-strategy.md\n@@ -96,8 +96,13 @@\n   P1 question without a test run: the field is present on every path that writes a line and the\n   reader is the only consumer. (iteration 1)\n - Tracing the brief-only branch separately caught the legacy-line behavior before it was mistaken\n   for a dropped field. (iteration 1)\n+- Reading the containment helper instead of the reader alone proved the Codex read lands on the\n+  path `realpathSync` produced, and the changed test asserts both the link miss and the resolved\n+  hit. (iteration 2)\n+- Checking the holdout guard by row id rather than by prompt text kept the rule while proving\n+  the G2 fixed table holds no corpus row. (iteration 2)\n \n ---\n \n ## 9. WHAT FAILED\n","status":"modified","additions":5,"deletions":0}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-confirm-4b/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"- Tracing the brief-only branch separately caught the legacy-line behavior before it was mistaken\\n  for a dropped field. (iteration 1)\\n- Reading the containment helper instead of the reader alone proved the Codex read lands on the\\n  path `realpathSync` produced, and the changed test asserts both the link miss and the resolved\\n  hit. (iteration 2)\\n- Checking the holdout guard by row id rather than by prompt text kept the rule while proving\\n  the G2 fixed table holds no corpus row. (iteration 2)\",\"oldString\":\"- Tracing the brief-only branch separately caught the legacy-line behavior before it was mistaken\\n  for a dropped field. (iteration 1)\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-confirm-4b/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794681037841,"end":179