.mjs:169 reads storePath and codex.test.mjs:117-127 asserts the link is never opened.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":2}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"ruled_out\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"AR4B-RO-005\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"a link inside the Codex store escapes it\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"identity.mjs:104-116 realpaths both sides and checks containment before the open.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":2}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"ruled_out\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"AR4B-RO-006\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"a holdout row reaches a live turn through the G2 fixed table\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"the G2 ids are runner-owned and appear in neither corpus; findRow refuses split holdout for every other id.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":2}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"ruled_out\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"AR4B-RO-007\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"a replayed offer runs code from an untrusted checkout\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"backfillRunLog calls trusted() before replay, and a live arm refuses a remote or unmarked arena.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":2}\\n\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-confirm-4b/deltas/iter-002.jsonl\"}"},"time":{"start":1794681096396,"end":1794681110812}}}}
