 P2 (Suggestions): 0\n- Resolved: 0\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:running-findings -->\n\n=== next focus ===\n<!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n## 11. NEXT FOCUS\n- Dimension: RECOVERY (least-covered traceability and maintainability) - Focus area: docs/code agreement for the `offeredAs` fix and the A11 malformed-router row. - Reason: two clean iterations reached the stuck threshold; the remaining evidence is documentation and checklist alignment, not a new security angle. - Rotation status: correctness and security complete; traceability and maintainability remain. - Required evidence: direct reads of the README field lists against both writers, the verify report's accepted items, and the A11 guidance against the doctor check and embed code. - Blocked/productive carry-forward: no blocked approach. - Recovery note: recovery pass changes granularity to line-level doc claims.\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n=== files table ===\n## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\n\n| File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\n|------|-------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-offer.mjs` | D1 | 1 | 0 | partial |\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs` | D1 | 1 | 0 | partial |\n| `.skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/codex.mjs` | - | - | - | pending |\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md` | - | - | - | pending |\n| `.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-agents-md-presentation.txt` | - | - | - | pending |\n\n---\n\n## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\n- [ ] traceability\n- [ ] maintainability\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n\n---\n\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n\n- The attach module, scorer fusion, recomme